  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Je vais aller la rassurer pour qu\u2019elle t\u2019emb\xEAte
    plus"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 368af27e801a8f643a3763179d93db07, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Merci Cap\u2019taine, j\u2019vais enfin pouvoir \xEAtre tranquille sans qu\u2019elle
      panique toutes les deux minutes."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
